Muse Pocket

Contains a modified ESP32 source snapshot of Muse Gadget SDK:
https://github.com/facebookincubator/muse-gadget-sdk
Upstream commit: 7e7123e2815d3e7e3c0f2ca330f576290ae6a6a9
